<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/42/msa@/~cl_3> <https://schema.org/name> "Seksyen 32 Akta ibu dipinda—"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/42/msa@> .
